<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-DAUPHINE LIBERE PROLOGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-DAUPHINE LIBERE PROLOGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GRENOBLE, France 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results in the</p>
<p>5.1-km prologue of the Dauphine Libere cycle race on Sunday:</p>
<p> 1. Chris Boardman (Britain) GAN    5 minutes 50 seconds</p>
<p>2. Alex Zuelle (Switzerland) ONCE  3 second behind</p>
<p> 3. Viacheslav Yekimov (Russia) US Postal    3</p>
<p> 4. Philippe Gaumont (France) Cofidis	  5</p>
<p> 5. Abraham Olano (Spain) Banesto		6</p>
<p> 6. Jose-Vicente Garcia (Spain) Banesto	6</p>
<p> 7. Erik Dekker (Netherlands) Rabobank	 7</p>
<p> 8. Adriano Baffi (Italy) US Postal	    8</p>
<p> 9. Laurent Brochard (France) Festina	  8</p>
<p>10. Michael Boogerd (Netherlands) Rabobank 11</p>
